@page "/rules"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Rules";
}

<h1>Rules</h1>

<div class="mu-panel">
    <div class="mu-panel__body">
        <h2>Accounts</h2>
        <p>One person may hold several accounts. Sharing an account with someone else is at your own
           risk &mdash; an account is only ever recovered to the person who registered it.</p>

        <h2>Fair play</h2>
        <p>Modifying the client to gain an advantage, automating outside the in-game helper, exploiting
           a bug instead of reporting it, and buying or selling items for real money are all grounds for
           a ban.</p>

        <h2>Conduct</h2>
        <p>Harassment, impersonating a game master, and advertising other servers in chat are not
           allowed. Player killing is part of the game and is not a rule violation.</p>

        <h2>Bans</h2>
        <p>A ban takes effect the next time the account tries to log in. Temporary bans lift by
           themselves. If you think a ban was a mistake, contact an administrator.</p>
    </div>
</div>
